{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>4-7-8 Breathing + Theta Waves 是一款以視覺引導呼吸節奏的放鬆工具，跟隨發光線條即可完成吸氣 4 秒、閉氣 7 秒、呼氣 8 秒的循環，適合工作壓力較大、睡前難以靜心，或希望建立每日呼吸練習習慣的讀者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-47.webp\">\n<h2>跟隨光線節奏呼吸</h2>\n<p>畫面以柔和光線引導呼吸：吸氣上升、閉氣持平、呼氣下降，配合倒數、鈴聲與震動提示切換，閉眼亦可跟隨。戴上耳機可加入 5 Hz Theta 雙耳節拍加強放鬆。每次 4 輪約 80 秒，可設定每日 3 至 5 節、為期 30 至 90 天並定時提醒；小工具顯示剩餘天數與進度。無需帳號，沒有廣告與追蹤，資料只留在 iPhone。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-292-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-293-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-294-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-295-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-296-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-297-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：4-7-8 Breathing + Theta Waves</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.505843+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:22:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:39:28.359749+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:18.995400+00:00","content_hash":"bb8abdfc1bd83aff0c910c16f1345ded2376df54ed88c6dc3ea4d0cd11a00c2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}